  "title": "Automatic Evoked Response Detection (ER-Detect) dataset",
  "description": "This dataset comprises intracranial EEG recordings collected to support the development and validation of automatic evoked response detection (ER-Detect) methods. Data were gathered from patients undergoing electrical stimulation mapping at Mayo Clinic and University Medical Center Utrecht, aiming to characterize cortico-cortical evoked potentials for clinical and research applications in epilepsy and brain connectivity studies.",
